{"key":"enterprise/T1027.018","id":"T1027.018","name":"Invisible Unicode","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1027","tactics":["stealth"],"platforms":["Linux","macOS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may abuse invisible or non-printing Unicode characters to conceal malicious content within files, scripts, or text. By inserting characters that do not visibly render, adversaries may hide data, alter how content is interpreted, or make malicious code appear as benign text or whitespace. Adversaries may encode these malicious payloads, using binary, Base64, or custom schemes, to be reconstructed at runtime through scripting features…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1027/018","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--e9b75bb0-b5ec-42c8-b728-f4f424d9c39e","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.723Z","source_object_version":"1.0","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0055","name":"File Access","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0055","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--235b7491-2d2b-4617-9a52-3c0783680f71","page":"telemetry/DC0055/"},{"id":"DC0039","name":"File Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0039","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--2b3bfe19-d59a-460d-93bb-2f546adc2d2c","page":"telemetry/DC0039/"},{"id":"DC0059","name":"File Metadata","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0059","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--639e87f3-acb6-448a-9645-258f20da4bc5","page":"telemetry/DC0059/"},{"id":"DC0016","name":"Module Load","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0016","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--c0a4a086-cc20-4e1e-b7cb-29d99dfa3fb1","page":"telemetry/DC0016/"},{